{"seq":1,"slug":"push-notifications","title":"推送通知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/capabilities-and-deploy/push-notifications","wordCount":1716,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"推送通知\">推送通知</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Web Push Notifications（Web 推送通知）让服务器能够向用户设备发送通知——即使 PWA 未打开。这让 PWA 的用户重新触达能力接近原生应用。Web 推送基于 W3C Push API + Notification API + VAPID（自愿应用服务器标识）规范。浏览器通过推送服务（FCM / Mozilla / Apple）将消息路由到设备，Service Worker 接收后展示通知。本节涵盖推送通知完整流程、订阅机制、服务器发送、Service Worker 处理、权限请求体验设计、iOS 16.4 限制、以及最佳实践。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 订阅</td>\n<td>客户端</td>\n<td>获取推送订阅端点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 存储订阅</td>\n<td>服务器</td>\n<td>保存用户的端点信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 触发推送</td>\n<td>服务器</td>\n<td>通过推送服务发送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 推送服务</td>\n<td>FCM / Mozilla / Apple</td>\n<td>路由到设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5. 接收</td>\n<td>浏览器 Service Worker</td>\n<td>触发 push 事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6. 展示</td>\n<td>Service Worker</td>\n<td>调用 showNotification()</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7. 点击</td>\n<td>用户</td>\n<td>触发 notificationclick 事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"vapid-密钥\">VAPID 密钥</h2><p><strong>VAPID（Voluntary Application Server Identification，自愿应用服务器标识）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>服务器使用 ECDSA 密钥对签名推送请求。</li>\n<li>公钥分发给客户端。</li>\n<li>推送服务验证签名确保来源合法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>生成密钥对</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npx web-push generate-vapid-keys\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web-push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> generate-vapid-keys</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>输出示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Public Key: BL...&#10;Private Key: kS...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Public Key: BL...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Private Key: kS...</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>密钥存储</strong>：公钥同时存储在客户端和服务器端；私钥仅存储在服务器端，绝不暴露给客户端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"订阅流程\">订阅流程</h2><p><strong>客户端订阅推送</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"async function subscribe() {&#10;  // 1. 请求通知权限&#10;  const permission = await Notification.requestPermission();&#10;  if (permission !== &#39;granted&#39;) return;&#10;&#10;  // 2. 获取 Service Worker 注册&#10;  const reg = await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;&#10;&#10;  // 3. 订阅推送&#10;  const sub = await reg.pushManager.subscribe({&#10;    userVisibleOnly: true,&#10;    applicationServerKey: urlBase64ToUint8Array(VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  // 4. 将订阅信息发送到服务器保存&#10;  await fetch(&#39;/api/subscribe&#39;, {&#10;    method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;    body: JSON.stringify(sub),&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function subscribe() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 1. 请求通知权限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const permission = await Notification.requestPermission();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (permission !== 'granted') return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 2. 获取 Service Worker 注册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const reg = await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 3. 订阅推送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const sub = await reg.pushManager.subscribe({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    userVisibleOnly: true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    applicationServerKey: urlBase64ToUint8Array(VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 4. 将订阅信息发送到服务器保存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await fetch('/api/subscribe', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    method: 'POST',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    body: JSON.stringify(sub),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>订阅对象结构</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;endpoint&quot;: &quot;https://fcm.googleapis.com/...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;keys&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;p256dh&quot;: &quot;...&quot;,&#10;    &quot;auth&quot;: &quot;...&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"endpoint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://fcm.googleapis.com/...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"keys\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"p256dh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"auth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>服务器需要存储该订阅对象，后续发送推送时使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"服务器发送推送\">服务器发送推送</h2><p><strong>Node.js 使用 web-push 库</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const webpush = require(&#39;web-push&#39;);&#10;&#10;webpush.setVapidDetails(&#10;  &#39;mailto:admin@example.com&#39;,&#10;  VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY,&#10;  VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY&#10;);&#10;&#10;// 发送推送&#10;const subscription = { endpoint: &#39;...&#39;, keys: {...} };&#10;const payload = JSON.stringify({&#10;  title: &#39;你好！&#39;,&#10;  body: &#39;你收到了一条新消息&#39;,&#10;  url: &#39;/inbox&#39;&#10;});&#10;&#10;await webpush.sendNotification(subscription, payload);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const webpush = require('web-push');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>webpush.setVapidDetails(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'mailto:admin@example.com',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 发送推送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const subscription = { endpoint: '...', keys: {...} };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const payload = JSON.stringify({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: '你好！',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body: '你收到了一条新消息',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  url: '/inbox'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await webpush.sendNotification(subscription, payload);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>其他语言的推送库</strong>：Python 使用 pywebpush，Go 使用 webpush-go，Ruby 使用 web-push gem。</p>\n<h2 id=\"service-worker-推送处理\">Service Worker 推送处理</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"self.addEventListener(&#39;push&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  const data = event.data?.json() || {};&#10;&#10;  event.waitUntil(&#10;    self.registration.showNotification(data.title, {&#10;      body: data.body,&#10;      icon: &#39;/icon-192.png&#39;,&#10;      badge: &#39;/badge-72.png&#39;,&#10;      data: { url: data.url },&#10;      actions: [&#10;        { action: &#39;open&#39;, title: &#39;打开&#39; },&#10;        { action: &#39;dismiss&#39;, title: &#39;忽略&#39; },&#10;      ],&#10;    }),&#10;  );&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('push', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const data = event.data?.json() || {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  event.waitUntil(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    self.registration.showNotification(data.title, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      body: data.body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      icon: '/icon-192.png',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      badge: '/badge-72.png',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      data: { url: data.url },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      actions: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        { action: 'open', title: '打开' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        { action: 'dismiss', title: '忽略' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>通知选项说明</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>title</code>、<code>body</code>：标题和正文内容。</li>\n<li><code>icon</code>、<code>badge</code>：图标和角标。</li>\n<li><code>image</code>：大图预览。</li>\n<li><code>actions</code>：自定义操作按钮。</li>\n<li><code>data</code>：自定义负载数据（如跳转 URL）。</li>\n<li><code>tag</code>：标签（同标签通知会相互替换）。</li>\n<li><code>requireInteraction</code>：是否需要用户手动关闭。</li>\n<li><code>silent</code>：静音通知。</li>\n<li><code>vibrate</code>：震动模式（仅移动端）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"通知点击处理\">通知点击处理</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"self.addEventListener(&#39;notificationclick&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  event.notification.close();&#10;&#10;  if (event.action === &#39;dismiss&#39;) return;&#10;&#10;  const url = event.notification.data.url || &#39;/&#39;;&#10;  event.waitUntil(&#10;    clients.matchAll({ type: &#39;window&#39; }).then((windowClients) =&gt; {&#10;      // 如果已有窗口打开则聚焦&#10;      for (const client of windowClients) {&#10;        if (client.url === url) return client.focus();&#10;      }&#10;      // 否则打开新窗口&#10;      return clients.openWindow(url);&#10;    }),&#10;  );&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('notificationclick', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  event.notification.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (event.action === 'dismiss') return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const url = event.notification.data.url || '/';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  event.waitUntil(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    clients.matchAll({ type: 'window' }).then((windowClients) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 如果已有窗口打开则聚焦</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      for (const client of windowClients) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (client.url === url) return client.focus();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 否则打开新窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return clients.openWindow(url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[服务器] --&gt;|VAPID签名 + 负载| B[推送服务 FCM/Mozilla/Apple]&#10;    B --&gt;|路由到设备| C[浏览器]&#10;    C --&gt;|push事件| D[Service Worker]&#10;    D --&gt;|showNotification| E[操作系统通知]&#10;    E --&gt;|用户点击| D&#10;    D --&gt;|notificationclick| F[打开目标页面]\">graph LR\n    A[服务器] --&gt;|VAPID签名 + 负载| B[推送服务 FCM/Mozilla/Apple]\n    B --&gt;|路由到设备| C[浏览器]\n    C --&gt;|push事件| D[Service Worker]\n    D --&gt;|showNotification| E[操作系统通知]\n    E --&gt;|用户点击| D\n    D --&gt;|notificationclick| F[打开目标页面]</pre><h2 id=\"权限请求体验设计\">权限请求体验设计</h2><p><strong>反模式</strong>：用户刚进入网站就立即弹出权限请求——大多数用户会直接拒绝。</p>\n<p><strong>最佳实践</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 先解释再请求</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"&lt;Modal&gt;&#10;  &lt;h3&gt;开启通知&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;  &lt;p&gt;当有人给你发消息时，我们会通知你。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;  &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; requestPermission()}&gt;开启通知&lt;/button&gt;&#10;  &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; skip()}&gt;以后再说&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/Modal&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;Modal></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;h3>开启通知&#x3C;/h3></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;p>当有人给你发消息时，我们会通知你。&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;button onClick={() => requestPermission()}>开启通知&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;button onClick={() => skip()}>以后再说&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/Modal></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>2. 在用户操作后触发</strong>：例如用户发送完消息后、完成引导流程后。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 不要立即重新请求</strong>：如果用户拒绝，等待数天或数周后再考虑提示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ios-16-4-限制\">iOS 16.4+ 限制</h2><p><strong>Apple 长期对 Web Push 持保守态度</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>iOS 16.4 之前：完全不支持 Web Push。</li>\n<li>iOS 16.4（2023 年）起：支持，但有前提条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>iOS PWA 推送限制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>必须先将应用添加到主屏幕（Add to Home Screen）。</li>\n<li>然后才能订阅推送。</li>\n<li>Safari 浏览器内直接访问不支持。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Safari macOS</strong>：16.0 起标准支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"浏览器兼容性\">浏览器兼容性</h2><p><strong>Chrome / Edge / Firefox</strong>：完整支持。</p>\n<p><strong>Safari macOS</strong>：16.0 及以上版本支持。</p>\n<p><strong>Safari iOS</strong>：16.4 及以上版本，需先添加到主屏幕。</p>\n<p><strong>Samsung Internet / Opera</strong>：支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通知权限状态\">通知权限状态</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"console.log(Notification.permission);&#10;// &#39;default&#39; | &#39;granted&#39; | &#39;denied&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(Notification.permission);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 'default' | 'granted' | 'denied'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>一旦被拒绝</strong>：无法再自动弹出权限请求，用户必须手动在浏览器设置中重新开启。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试推送通知\">测试推送通知</h2><p><strong>Chrome DevTools 测试</strong>：Application 标签页 → Service Workers → 点击&quot;Push&quot;按钮，可模拟推送事件。</p>\n<p><strong>服务器端测试</strong>：使用 web-push 命令行工具或库发送真实推送。</p>\n<p><strong>验证订阅有效性</strong>：使用 web-push 库测试端点是否有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通知频率控制\">通知频率控制</h2><p><strong>避免过度推送</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每用户每天最多 1-3 条推送。</li>\n<li>基于用户活跃时间段发送。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>分类管理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>直接消息（高优先级）。</li>\n<li>每日摘要（低优先级）。</li>\n<li>营销推广（最低优先级）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>让用户自主控制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按类别独立订阅或退订。</li>\n<li>提供&quot;免打扰时段&quot;设置。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"标签去重\">标签去重</h2><p><strong>使用 tag 替换同类通知</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"self.registration.showNotification(&#39;新消息&#39;, {&#10;  tag: &#39;message-123&#39;, // 相同 tag 的通知会相互替换&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>self.registration.showNotification('新消息', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tag: 'message-123', // 相同 tag 的通知会相互替换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果</strong>：同一对话的多次更新只显示一条通知，而非堆积 N 条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"操作按钮\">操作按钮</h2><p><strong>自定义通知按钮</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"{&#10;  actions: [&#10;    { action: &#39;reply&#39;, title: &#39;回复&#39;, icon: &#39;/reply.png&#39; },&#10;    { action: &#39;archive&#39;, title: &#39;归档&#39; },&#10;  ];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  actions: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { action: 'reply', title: '回复', icon: '/reply.png' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { action: 'archive', title: '归档' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>在点击事件中处理不同操作</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"self.addEventListener(&#39;notificationclick&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.action === &#39;reply&#39;) {&#10;    // 打开回复界面&#10;  } else if (event.action === &#39;archive&#39;) {&#10;    // 在后台执行归档操作&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('notificationclick', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (event.action === 'reply') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 打开回复界面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } else if (event.action === 'archive') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 在后台执行归档操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"富媒体通知\">富媒体通知</h2><p><strong>带大图预览的通知</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"{&#10;  title: &#39;新照片&#39;,&#10;  body: &#39;来自 Alice&#39;,&#10;  image: &#39;/photo-large.jpg&#39;,  // 大图预览&#10;  icon: &#39;/icon.png&#39;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: '新照片',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body: '来自 Alice',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  image: '/photo-large.jpg',  // 大图预览</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  icon: '/icon.png'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>支持情况</strong>：Chrome / Edge 桌面端支持较好，移动端表现因平台而异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"静默推送的限制\">静默推送的限制</h2><p><strong>规范要求 <code>userVisibleOnly: true</code></strong>：浏览器强制要求每次推送必须展示可见通知，不支持真正的静默推送。</p>\n<p><strong>替代方案</strong>：显示低优先级通知，或使用周期性后台同步（Periodic Background Sync）替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐私保护\">隐私保护</h2><p><strong>订阅信息是设备标识符</strong>：端点 URL 在每个设备和浏览器中唯一，使用时需谨慎，不要分享给第三方。</p>\n<p><strong>退订流程</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const sub = await reg.pushManager.getSubscription();&#10;await sub.unsubscribe();&#10;await fetch(&#39;/api/unsubscribe&#39;, { method: &#39;POST&#39;, body: sub.endpoint });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const sub = await reg.pushManager.getSubscription();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await sub.unsubscribe();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await fetch('/api/unsubscribe', { method: 'POST', body: sub.endpoint });</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"服务器端存储\">服务器端存储</h2><p><strong>数据库表结构示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE push_subscriptions (&#10;  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  user_id INT,&#10;  endpoint TEXT,&#10;  p256dh TEXT,&#10;  auth TEXT,&#10;  created_at TIMESTAMP,&#10;  UNIQUE(endpoint)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> push_subscriptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  p256dh </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  auth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>清理过期订阅</strong>：收到 <code>410 Gone</code> 响应时删除对应订阅，不要向已过期的端点发送推送。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理\">错误处理</h2><p><strong>常见错误码</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>410 Gone</code>：订阅已过期。</li>\n<li><code>404 Not Found</code>：端点无效。</li>\n<li><code>413 Payload Too Large</code>：负载过大，需要精简内容。</li>\n<li><code>429 Too Many Requests</code>：触发速率限制。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"try {&#10;  await webpush.sendNotification(sub, payload);&#10;} catch (err) {&#10;  if (err.statusCode === 410 || err.statusCode === 404) {&#10;    await deleteSubscription(sub.endpoint);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await webpush.sendNotification(sub, payload);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} catch (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (err.statusCode === 410 || err.statusCode === 404) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await deleteSubscription(sub.endpoint);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见反模式\">常见反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 页面加载立即请求权限</strong>：用户必然拒绝。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 不解释请求原因</strong>：用户感到困惑。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 推送频率过高</strong>：用户退订或禁用通知。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 不分类管理</strong>：用户只能全部退订。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 不清理过期订阅</strong>：浪费资源向无效端点发送。</p>\n<p><strong>6. 仅发送营销内容</strong>：用户很快忽略所有通知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><p><strong>1. 请求前先说明价值</strong>：告诉用户开启通知能获得什么。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 在用户操作后触发</strong>：不要在页面加载时请求。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 按类别管理订阅</strong>：让用户选择接收哪类通知。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 控制发送频率</strong>：质量优先于数量。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 定期清理过期订阅</strong>：保持数据库健康。</p>\n<p><strong>6. 多平台测试</strong>：在不同浏览器和操作系统上验证表现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Web 推送通知让服务器能向设备发送通知（即使 PWA 未打开），基于 W3C Push API + Notification API + VAPID 规范。VAPID 使用 ECDSA 密钥对签名推送请求以验证来源。订阅流程为：请求通知权限 → 获取推送订阅对象 → 将订阅信息发送到服务器保存。服务器通过 web-push 等库向推送服务发送消息。Service Worker 在 push 事件中调用 showNotification 展示通知，在 notificationclick 事件中处理用户点击。权限请求体验的关键是先解释价值再请求、在用户操作后触发、被拒绝后不立即重试。iOS 16.4+ 支持 Web Push 但要求先添加到主屏幕。通知频率应控制在每天 1-3 条，按类别让用户自主订阅。服务器端需要及时清理过期订阅（处理 410 Gone 响应）。推送通知是 PWA 用户重新触达的核心能力——设计得当能显著提升用户参与度，设计不当则只会让用户禁用通知。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推送通知","id":"推送通知"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"VAPID 密钥","id":"vapid-密钥"},{"level":2,"text":"订阅流程","id":"订阅流程"},{"level":2,"text":"服务器发送推送","id":"服务器发送推送"},{"level":2,"text":"Service Worker 推送处理","id":"service-worker-推送处理"},{"level":2,"text":"通知点击处理","id":"通知点击处理"},{"level":2,"text":"权限请求体验设计","id":"权限请求体验设计"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 16.4+ 限制","id":"ios-16-4-限制"},{"level":2,"text":"浏览器兼容性","id":"浏览器兼容性"},{"level":2,"text":"通知权限状态","id":"通知权限状态"},{"level":2,"text":"测试推送通知","id":"测试推送通知"},{"level":2,"text":"通知频率控制","id":"通知频率控制"},{"level":2,"text":"标签去重","id":"标签去重"},{"level":2,"text":"操作按钮","id":"操作按钮"},{"level":2,"text":"富媒体通知","id":"富媒体通知"},{"level":2,"text":"静默推送的限制","id":"静默推送的限制"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私保护","id":"隐私保护"},{"level":2,"text":"服务器端存储","id":"服务器端存储"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理","id":"错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"常见反模式","id":"常见反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"离线状态用户体验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/offline-data/offline-state-ux"},"next":{"title":"原生平台能力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/capabilities-and-deploy/native-platform-features"}}